reconstructed research.md "Static facts" (TraceCommand: -p without -nl -> "Missing log level.") and D-11 for trace --package 'com.inubit.ibis.acme' without --nodelevel; CliCommand never builds this form; error layout as fixtures/server-log/v8_1/trace/forbidden.stdout.
